        <div class="options-group">
            <label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="Microsoft" required> Microsoft</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="Sun Microsystems"> Sun Microsystems</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="Apple"> Apple</label>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="question-block">
        <p><strong>7. What is the correct way to write a comment in CSS?</strong></p>
        <div class="options-group">
            <label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="/* comment */" required> /* comment */</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="// comment"> // comment</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="&lt;!-- comment --&gt;"> &lt;!-- comment --&gt;</label>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="question-block">
        <p><strong>8. Which protocol is used to securely transfer web pages over the internet?</strong></p>
        <div class="options-group">
            <label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="HTTP" required> HTTP</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="FTP"> FTP</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="HTTPS"> HTTPS</label>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="question-block">
        <p><strong>9. In relational databases, what does a primary key uniquely identify?</strong></p>
        <div class="options-group">
            <label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="A column" required> A column</label>
